WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:04.710
In a remote place, under a
palm tree, a woman gives birth.

2
00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:07.120
Her people accuse her of wrongdoing.

3
00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:10.000
She says nothing, and points to her baby.

4
00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:13.240
In the Qur'an, the baby
speaks from the cradle.

5
00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:17.460
Muslims believe this child,
Isa, had no human father,

6
00:00:17.510 --> 00:00:21.120
and later healed the blind
and even raised the dead.

7
00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:24.180
So why don't Muslims call him God's Son?

8
00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:29.740
In this mission, you'll read Surah 19, the
chapter named after his mother, Maryam.

9
00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:33.860
Then you'll compare different views
of how his life on earth ended.

10
00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:39.060
Your mission: find out why Muslims, who
believe in his virgin birth and miracles,

11
00:00:39.110 --> 00:00:41.090
do not call him God's Son.
